WEBVTT

00:08:28.773 --> 00:08:31.004
Cheryl and her team
didn't know who was who,

00:08:31.028 --> 00:08:33.180
so that they couldn't
influence the results.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:39.620
And after she had time
to analyze that second set of data,

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:41.167
she sent me that image.

00:08:41.968 --> 00:08:43.528
She said,

00:08:43.552 --> 00:08:46.364
"Dude A's dominance of your brain

00:08:46.388 --> 00:08:48.558
seems to essentially have been eradicated.

00:08:48.582 --> 00:08:52.764
I think this is the desired result,"
comma, yes, question mark.

00:08:52.788 --> 00:08:55.167
(Laughter)

00:08:55.984 --> 00:08:58.116
And that was the exactly
the desired result.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.689
And finally, I allowed myself
a moment to introspect,